<!--
    Shown in LIGHT mode: a moon, because pressing the button gives you dark.
    The sun lives in drawable-night under this same name, so the swap is done by the
    resource qualifier and no code ever chooses between them.

    One closed outline, not two circles subtracted with evenOdd: with two circles the
    part of the cutout that falls outside the disc is covered an odd number of times and
    fills in too, which draws a blob rather than a crescent.
-->
